# Image signing cutover sentinel.
#
# A source revision that contains this file publishes runtime images signed
# keyless by .github/workflows/containers.yml (job `sign`). tools/install_images.py
# reads this path from the exact commit's Git tree: when present, every image of
# that revision must carry a valid signature, and --allow-unsigned-legacy is
# refused. Revisions without it predate signing.
#
# Do not remove or rename this file while containers.yml signs images;
# tools/test_install_images.py enforces that the two stay consistent.
